// Comparing two payloads by shape rather than by value.
//
// Its own package, and not part of ext/scenario, because both conformance
// checks need it and they do not run on the same targets: ext/test/mockrun is
// native-only (it drives a Client, so it needs `async test`), while
// ext/test/mockshape drives the mock synchronously and runs wherever `moon
// test` does. One implementation rather than two nearly-identical ones, so that
// a tolerance added for one check is a tolerance the other gets too.
import {
  "moonbitlang/core/json",
}
